      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "The quoting and installation process went reasonably well. However once installation was completed in March it took until may to organise an inspection and then August for them to get the certificate of compliance and connect me to the grid. Their customer service team is lazy and reluctant to offer any meaningful help or return emails/phone calls. Despite repeated attempts to contact them to get the process moving they eventually offer lame excuses and keep passing the buck. Once I finally got connected to the grid the optional smart meter/consumption monitoring I had them install as part of the package would not work. It took them several months and many attempts and many different technicians to work out that the problem was the original installer who was incompetent and installed it badly. The consumption monitoring has failed again now and after contacting them for support they are ghosting me. Sungrow are equally of no help either. I took the cheapest quote expecting the after sales service might be a little sketchy but these guys are useless. Steer well clear. Pay a little extra and go with a provider that does not use cheap external contractors.",
